r 3 days**\n\n$$\n\\text{Hotel cost} = 3 \\times 1800 = \\boxed{5400}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### **3. Total Trip Cost**\n\nNow, add the cost of the plane tickets and the hotel:\n\n$$\n\\text{Total cost} = \\text{Plane tickets} + \\text{Hotel cost} = 10000 + 5400 = \\boxed{15400}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 Final Answer:\n\n$$\n\\boxed{15400}\n$$\n\nSo, the total cost of the trip is **$15,400**.", "decode_seconds": 17.388588131871074, "draft_calls": 0, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 97, "method": "native_ar", "output_hash": "020270ae2c3b165d72fa6b2d8c5996b397dea2c048a941ca73134bf7002b4cd5", "output_tokens": 372, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 36866138624, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 37136367616, "problem_id": "gsm8k/051ae2b51a5de494", "profile_regions_ms": {"unattributed_runtime": 17466.535760089755}, "rank": 0, "reference_answer": "15400", "repetition": 0, "request_seconds": 17.466535760089755, "reserved_memory_after_bytes": 37136367616, "reserved_memory_before_bytes": 37136367616, "target_calls": 372, "time_to_first_token_seconds": 0.07631651777774096, "turn_index": 0}
