ons given by Maria's mom\n\nMaria's mom gave **each person** **3 more balloons**.\n\nThere are **5 people** in total, so:\n\n$$\n5 \\text{ people} \\times 3 \\text{ balloons} = 15 \\text{ balloons}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### Step 4: Total number of balloons\n\nNow, add the balloons from the start and the ones given by Maria's mom:\n\n$$\n9 \\text{ (initial)} + 15 \\text{ (from mom)} = \\boxed{24} \\text{ balloons}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 Final Answer:\n\n$$\n\\boxed{24}\n$$", "decode_seconds": 16.3519005603157, "draft_calls": 0, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 95, "method": "native_ar", "output_hash": "aabea2b031acc3c61e7037f1ea3360c5e242d8a6da0bba6af9d92baae4c8bfc2", "output_tokens": 350, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 36864697344, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 37203476480, "problem_id": "gsm8k/13d10b8bfcf30de5", "profile_regions_ms": {"unattributed_runtime": 16425.325859803706}, "rank": 0, "reference_answer": "24", "repetition": 0, "request_seconds": 16.425325859803706, "reserved_memory_after_bytes": 37203476480, "reserved_memory_before_bytes": 37203476480, "target_calls": 350, "time_to_first_token_seconds": 0.07206426374614239, "turn_index": 0}
